Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Settings=20=E2=86=92=20Plugins=20is=20the=20one?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20management=20page:=20Skills,=20MCP,=20Commands=20and=20Hooks?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20are=20its=20views=20(OV-100)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The four separate sidebar pages listed the same items as the Plugins tabs.
They remain routable aliases that open Plugins on the matching view. The
embedded Hooks view loads the shared plugin store with the page's host,
scope and Project list, so views no longer overwrite each other's list.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
